      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 (Ref2VA): images, a video and audio as references\n\nThe reference-to-video model of [MiniMax H3](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3) (its own weights,\n`minimax_h3_ref2va_*`). References enter as in-context tokens and are named in the prompt by their order per\nkind: `<Picture 1>`…`<Picture 9>`, `<Video 1>`…`<Video 3>`, `<Audio 1>`…`<Audio 3>`. Define the roles first\n(*\"<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>\"*, *\"<Audio 1> is the voice of <Subject 1>\"*), then describe the\nshots. Reordering references swaps their roles.\n\n**Settings**: 20 steps (25 for better motion; Turbo LoRA: 4), res_multistep, beta (beta or normal beat simple\nwith references), shift 12, short side 768, 24 fps. **ref_image_size**: `match` scales references to the\ngeneration's area; `max` keeps up to 2048 px for identity fidelity, several times slower.\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed, steps, scheduler, sampling method, Shift, size (MiniMax H3 Reference to Video) |\n| `ib:ref:0-3` | Picture 1-4 (bypassed) | References panel, images |\n| `ib:vref:0` | Video 1 (bypassed) | References panel, videos |\n| `ib:aref:0` | Audio 1 (bypassed) | References panel, audio |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**Pictures** (up to 4 here, the model takes 9: copy a loader, mark it `ib:ref:4` and link it to the next\n`ref_image` input): add them in the References panel of the Generate tab. Filled slots stay in order, so\n`<Picture N>` is the N-th image of the panel.\n\n**Video and audio references**: add a video or an audio file in the References panel too (also by dragging a\nvideo card from Generated). The video goes into **Video 1**: its frames become `<Video 1>` and its soundtrack an\n`<Audio N>` label placed before it (all audio labels are numbered together: a video's soundtrack first, then the\nstandalone clips). An audio file goes into **Audio 1**, a standalone voice or music reference. Clips of 2-15 s, at\nmost 15 s per kind, read as 24 fps (a 30 fps clip plays slower to the model); the panel shows the duration and\nframe rate of each clip and warns outside these limits. 12 files at most in all; more slots: copy a loader, mark\nit `ib:vref:1` / `ib:aref:1` and link it to the next input.\n\n**Length** is the Frames field of the Video tab (beside Sampling), which keeps it on the 17k+5 grid.\n\n## Model Links\n\n[Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**diffusion_models**: [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n**vae**: [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors), [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n**loras** (optional): [minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 Ref2VA (Image Bench)",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
